<h1>Walter &quot;Red&quot; Burnett</h1>
<p>27th Ward alderman, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Appointed in 2025, he is seeking his first full term and was gathering campaign petition signatures in the ward in July 2026. His official city biography says he is committed to expanding affordable housing, supporting local entrepreneurs and fostering safe, vibrant communities. No campaign website or detailed platform found yet.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>27th Ward alderman since 2025 (appointed to succeed his father, Walter Burnett Jr.); former investment banker who later advised local businesses, developers and artists.</p>
